1
00:01:08,300 --> 00:01:10,800
"Blue Lips"

2
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,800
(Episode 12)

3
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,260
A hundred thousand.

4
00:01:15,820 --> 00:01:16,820
No way.

5
00:01:17,280 --> 00:01:18,280
Two hundred thousand.

6
00:01:19,199 --> 00:01:19,880
A hundred and fifty thousand.

7
00:01:20,099 --> 00:01:21,099
That's all I have.

8
00:01:22,119 --> 00:01:23,416
I have plenty of friends
at the courthouse anyway.

9
00:01:23,440 --> 00:01:24,595
We can just take this to court.

10
00:01:24,619 --> 00:01:26,055
If you want to drag this out, be my guest.

11
00:01:26,079 --> 00:01:27,916
He can't afford to wait, but
I've got nothing but time.

12
00:01:27,940 --> 00:01:28,940
I can wait forever.

13
00:01:30,340 --> 00:01:30,659
Fine.

14
00:01:31,239 --> 00:01:32,396
A hundred and fifty thousand.

15
00:01:32,420 --> 00:01:33,780
Not a penny less.

16
00:01:34,579 --> 00:01:35,159
You want to drag it out?

17
00:01:35,400 --> 00:01:36,699
I can afford to wait.

18
00:01:38,119 --> 00:01:39,119
Go to court?

19
00:01:39,739 --> 00:01:40,739
I'm not afraid of you.

20
00:01:40,860 --> 00:01:42,599
Neither of us will have it easy anyway.

21
00:01:43,300 --> 00:01:44,555
It's settled. A hundred and fifty thousand.

22
00:01:44,579 --> 00:01:45,260
I'll give it to you next week.

23
00:01:45,460 --> 00:01:46,760
Next week? No way.

24
00:01:46,860 --> 00:01:47,860
It has to be today.

25
00:01:48,079 --> 00:01:50,139
Who knows where you'll
run off to by next week.

26
00:01:51,480 --> 00:01:52,480
Fine.

27
00:01:52,860 --> 00:01:53,860
If you guys

28
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,679
want to be unreasonable,

29
00:01:55,820 --> 00:01:57,300
I can haggle with you all day.

30
00:01:57,400 --> 00:01:58,720
I already called the cops anyway.

31
00:01:59,739 --> 00:02:00,760
When they get here,

32
00:02:00,900 --> 00:02:01,939
we can ask them

33
00:02:01,940 --> 00:02:03,500
how to settle you beating him up today.

34
00:02:05,199 --> 00:02:05,639
Fine.

35
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:07,059
Next week it is.

36
00:02:07,860 --> 00:02:08,300
Right.

37
00:02:08,860 --> 00:02:09,860
Zhulin Teahouse.

38
00:02:10,739 --> 00:02:12,219
Give me... give me your phone number.

39
00:02:16,559 --> 00:02:17,559
Are we good?

40
00:02:18,739 --> 00:02:19,739
Yeah.

41
00:02:24,820 --> 00:02:25,820
Everyone,

42
00:02:25,980 --> 00:02:27,599
I've recorded all of you.

43
00:02:28,239 --> 00:02:29,179
Please do me a favor

44
00:02:29,180 --> 00:02:30,658
and delete any photos

45
00:02:30,659 --> 00:02:31,980
or videos you took.

46
00:02:32,099 --> 00:02:33,518
Otherwise, I'll sue you for infringement.

47
00:02:33,519 --> 00:02:34,639
Thanks for your cooperation.

48
00:02:38,739 --> 00:02:39,119
Are you okay?
Let's go.

49
00:02:40,059 --> 00:02:40,699
Let's go inside

50
00:02:40,820 --> 00:02:41,820
and get you cleaned up.

51
00:02:42,059 --> 00:02:43,059
I don't need your help.

52
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,639
Where else are you hurt?

53
00:02:47,840 --> 00:02:48,840
Go away.

54
00:02:49,440 --> 00:02:50,860
I couldn't reach you earlier.

55
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,519
Your sister said your phone was broken

56
00:02:54,780 --> 00:02:56,140
and you didn't want to replace it.

57
00:02:57,679 --> 00:02:58,759
Does your mouth still hurt?

58
00:02:59,219 --> 00:02:59,900
Let me see.
What are you doing?

59
00:03:03,739 --> 00:03:04,739
I'm sorry, Shixian.

60
00:03:07,059 --> 00:03:08,059
I was late.

61
00:03:15,739 --> 00:03:16,739
Teng Mo,

62
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:20,139
I'm begging you, okay?

63
00:03:22,639 --> 00:03:23,639
Please.

64
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:28,659
Don't make me have any more illusions
or expectations about you.

65
00:03:29,639 --> 00:03:30,639
Is that alright?

66
00:03:32,079 --> 00:03:33,079
Shixian,

67
00:03:33,860 --> 00:03:34,960
give me a chance.

68
00:03:41,099 --> 00:03:42,139
Shixian, I...

69
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:46,800
Okay.

70
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:48,340
Just listen to me.

71
00:03:49,159 --> 00:03:50,159
There are some things.

72
00:03:50,920 --> 00:03:52,239
I've never told you.

73
00:03:54,539 --> 00:03:55,539
At first,

74
00:03:56,340 --> 00:03:58,038
I just wanted a stress-free,

75
00:03:58,039 --> 00:03:59,199
easygoing relationship.

76
00:03:59,900 --> 00:04:02,199
I didn't want to get too
deeply involved with anyone.

77
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,119
But then I realized I had changed.

78
00:04:07,219 --> 00:04:09,139
I became sensitive and suspicious,

79
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,440
constantly worrying about losing you.

80
00:04:11,739 --> 00:04:13,039
I wasn't myself anymore.

81
00:04:14,199 --> 00:04:15,199
I would get angry

82
00:04:15,280 --> 00:04:16,280
and lose my temper.

83
00:04:18,699 --> 00:04:19,719
I was terrified.

84
00:04:20,039 --> 00:04:21,039
I...

85
00:04:22,500 --> 00:04:24,500
I was afraid you'd end up despising me.

86
00:04:26,699 --> 00:04:27,699
So, I'm sorry.

87
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:29,960
I selfishly made the decision for you,

88
00:04:31,699 --> 00:04:32,940
and then I ran away.

89
00:04:35,059 --> 00:04:36,619
But later, I figured it out.

90
00:04:38,179 --> 00:04:39,500
In a real relationship,

91
00:04:39,699 --> 00:04:41,519
you have to go through pain and struggle.

92
00:04:42,139 --> 00:04:43,420
That's why I came back.

93
00:04:45,099 --> 00:04:46,579
I hope you can forgive me.

94
00:04:48,380 --> 00:04:51,602
I want to become an
indispensable part of your life.

95
00:04:55,039 --> 00:04:56,659
I used to be so afraid of the future,

96
00:04:58,300 --> 00:04:59,440
but being with you,

97
00:05:00,599 --> 00:05:02,420
I look forward to it every single day.

98
00:05:03,820 --> 00:05:05,380
I'm willing to prove myself.

99
00:05:10,059 --> 00:05:11,400
Will you believe me?

100
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:14,219
Will you give me another chance?

101
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:24,000
But...

102
00:05:25,380 --> 00:05:26,559
I'm not willing.

103
00:05:30,360 --> 00:05:31,440
I'm not willing.

104
00:05:34,880 --> 00:05:35,880
I... I...

105
00:05:35,940 --> 00:05:37,139
I was wrong, Shixian.

106
00:05:38,539 --> 00:05:40,039
What can I do to make you forgive me?

107
00:05:42,320 --> 00:05:43,460
Don't apologize to me.

108
00:05:44,719 --> 00:05:45,936
We're just not right for each other.

109
00:05:45,960 --> 00:05:46,780
How are we not right?
Tell me.

110
00:05:47,320 --> 00:05:48,320
I can change.

111
00:05:48,519 --> 00:05:49,519
You don't need to change.

112
00:05:50,340 --> 00:05:51,340
You're great.

113
00:05:52,519 --> 00:05:53,639
It's my fault.

114
00:05:54,059 --> 00:05:55,500
It's my fault, okay?

115
00:05:57,119 --> 00:05:58,119
You did nothing wrong.

116
00:05:59,079 --> 00:06:00,340
There's nothing wrong with you.

117
00:06:01,059 --> 00:06:02,059
Or...

118
00:06:02,199 --> 00:06:03,360
Or are you sick of me?

119
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,380
Have you fallen for someone else?

120
00:06:08,440 --> 00:06:09,440
Yes.

121
00:06:11,340 --> 00:06:12,360
I am sick of you.

122
00:06:14,059 --> 00:06:15,440
I'm completely sick of you.

123
00:06:16,820 --> 00:06:18,058
I've fallen for someone else.

124
00:06:18,059 --> 00:06:19,059
Are you happy now?

125
00:06:20,019 --> 00:06:21,019
Why are you lying?

126
00:06:21,059 --> 00:06:22,179
It's obviously a lie.

127
00:06:22,420 --> 00:06:24,158
Your eyes don't lie, Shixian.

128
00:06:24,159 --> 00:06:25,559
Then what do you want me to do?

129
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:28,900
Can love put food on the table?

130
00:06:30,840 --> 00:06:32,276
I want to give you a stable life too.

131
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:33,580
I want to give you a future too.

132
00:06:35,280 --> 00:06:36,800
But I only have a high school diploma.

133
00:06:37,579 --> 00:06:39,000
I don't have a steady job.

134
00:06:39,099 --> 00:06:39,960
I'm impulsive and reckless.

135
00:06:39,961 --> 00:06:41,000
I only cause trouble.

136
00:06:44,619 --> 00:06:45,920
Do you want me to drag you down?

137
00:06:53,500 --> 00:06:55,440
My family needs a lot of money.

138
00:06:57,699 --> 00:06:59,039
I'm just a burden.

139
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:01,760
No one will have a
good life being with me.

140
00:07:02,619 --> 00:07:04,219
I only cause trouble for people.

141
00:07:09,900 --> 00:07:10,900
I don't want that.

142
00:07:11,800 --> 00:07:12,800
So...

143
00:07:12,940 --> 00:07:14,599
But I don't mind the trouble.

144
00:07:15,420 --> 00:07:16,558
I... I'm not afraid of any of that.

145
00:07:16,559 --> 00:07:17,460
I'm not afraid of trouble.

146
00:07:17,461 --> 00:07:18,800
I don't think you're a burden.

147
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:21,239
But I'm afraid.

148
00:07:22,860 --> 00:07:23,860
I'm afraid.

149
00:07:26,579 --> 00:07:27,579
I'm afraid.

150
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,079
Actually,

151
00:07:31,780 --> 00:07:34,260
I also want an equal relationship.

152
00:07:37,199 --> 00:07:39,719
A partner I don't have to look up to.

153
00:07:40,179 --> 00:07:41,919
I don't want you to always take care of me,

154
00:07:41,920 --> 00:07:45,099
to always clean up my messes.

155
00:07:46,780 --> 00:07:49,159
It puts too much pressure
on me. I'm exhausted.

156
00:07:51,619 --> 00:07:53,300
This isn't the life I want.

157
00:07:56,079 --> 00:07:57,840
And I hate myself for being like this.

158
00:07:59,500 --> 00:08:00,500
Teng Mo,

159
00:08:03,920 --> 00:08:04,960
while you still

160
00:08:05,780 --> 00:08:06,879
don't feel

161
00:08:06,880 --> 00:08:08,699
annoyed or disgusted by me,

162
00:08:10,539 --> 00:08:11,539
if we break up now,

163
00:08:11,820 --> 00:08:14,400
maybe we can still keep some good memories.

164
00:08:17,880 --> 00:08:19,239
Is that really what you think?

165
00:08:23,739 --> 00:08:24,739
Yes.

166
00:08:28,420 --> 00:08:29,699
So get out of here.

167
00:08:29,899 --> 00:08:31,180
Don't make me curse at you.

168
00:08:36,260 --> 00:08:37,260
Get lost!

169
00:08:37,739 --> 00:08:38,739
Fine.

170
00:08:39,859 --> 00:08:40,859
I get it.

171
00:09:30,060 --> 00:09:31,060
Shixian,

172
00:09:32,420 --> 00:09:33,420
where did you go?

173
00:09:33,739 --> 00:09:35,179
It was so noisy downstairs just now.

174
00:09:35,279 --> 00:09:36,439
You didn't get hurt, did you?

175
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:42,960
Wait a minute.

176
00:09:43,960 --> 00:09:45,000
Lift your head up.

177
00:09:57,199 --> 00:09:58,399
What happened?

178
00:09:59,479 --> 00:10:00,479
Sis,

179
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:01,920
I'm fine.

180
00:10:04,260 --> 00:10:05,260
Was it Teng Mo?

181
00:10:05,760 --> 00:10:06,840
Did Teng Mo hurt you?

182
00:10:06,960 --> 00:10:07,220
No.

183
00:10:07,399 --> 00:10:08,399
It wasn't him.

184
00:10:15,399 --> 00:10:15,699
Sis,

185
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,060
I'm going out for a bit.

186
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:18,600
Shixian!

187
00:10:18,739 --> 00:10:19,760
Where are you going now?

188
00:10:20,140 --> 00:10:21,140
Shixian!

189
00:10:44,100 --> 00:10:45,100
Shixian!

190
00:10:45,720 --> 00:10:46,720
I'm leaving.

191
00:10:47,720 --> 00:10:49,680
I'm sorry for saying goodbye like this.

192
00:10:50,300 --> 00:10:52,439
I'm really not good at farewells.

193
00:10:53,579 --> 00:10:55,099
Thank you so much for everything recently,

194
00:10:55,100 --> 00:10:56,700
for indulging me and keeping me company.

195
00:10:57,819 --> 00:10:58,979
The days I've spent with you

196
00:10:59,520 --> 00:11:01,920
have been the happiest
times I've had in years.

197
00:11:03,439 --> 00:11:05,380
But all good things must come to an end.

198
00:11:06,199 --> 00:11:07,795
Being able to walk this
part of the journey together

199
00:11:07,819 --> 00:11:09,499
has been the greatest blessing of my life.

200
00:11:11,039 --> 00:11:12,420
The money on this card is for you.

201
00:11:12,819 --> 00:11:13,899
The PIN is your birthday.

202
00:11:14,399 --> 00:11:16,639
This money will do more
good in your hands than in mine.

203
00:11:17,279 --> 00:11:18,279
Don't refuse it.

204
00:11:19,300 --> 00:11:20,780
You can't mix your meds with alcohol.

205
00:11:21,039 --> 00:11:22,839
No one will be watching
over you from now on.

206
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:24,699
If possible,

207
00:11:25,039 --> 00:11:26,595
go back to school for a few more years.

208
00:11:26,619 --> 00:11:27,619
Study a bit more.

209
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:30,380
Your path in life will be much smoother.

210
00:11:31,199 --> 00:11:32,199
I won't say goodbye.

211
00:11:33,159 --> 00:11:34,279
I wish you a happy marriage.

212
00:11:34,380 --> 00:11:35,660
May your life be smooth sailing.

213
00:11:35,859 --> 00:11:37,339
May you always be happy and carefree.

214
00:11:37,539 --> 00:11:38,539
Teng Mo.

215
00:11:46,819 --> 00:11:48,239
Didn't I tell you to get lost?

216
00:11:49,739 --> 00:11:50,960
Why did you come back?

217
00:12:00,720 --> 00:12:02,200
The person I love most is right here.

218
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:04,680
Where else could I go?

219
00:12:05,100 --> 00:12:05,819
Shixian.

220
00:12:05,960 --> 00:12:06,960
Look.

221
00:12:12,600 --> 00:12:13,140
Alright.

222
00:12:13,300 --> 00:12:14,300
Stop crying.

223
00:12:14,439 --> 00:12:15,640
I didn't leave, did I?

224
00:12:19,659 --> 00:12:20,939
I couldn't buy a ring right now,

225
00:12:23,340 --> 00:12:25,380
so I found a temporary replacement.

226
00:12:27,399 --> 00:12:28,399
I'm sorry.

227
00:12:29,060 --> 00:12:30,060
Why would you say that?

228
00:12:35,100 --> 00:12:36,600
I was too selfish.

229
00:12:41,460 --> 00:12:42,579
I always thought

230
00:12:44,640 --> 00:12:46,979
love was about two equals

231
00:12:47,779 --> 00:12:48,779
giving to each other.

232
00:12:50,500 --> 00:12:52,800
But I've just been taking
everything you give.

233
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:56,420
I just feel,

234
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:01,880
I feel so guilty.

235
00:13:04,579 --> 00:13:06,300
It's because I like you too much.

236
00:13:07,659 --> 00:13:09,460
I like you so much that.

237
00:13:10,680 --> 00:13:12,840
I'm afraid by the time I'm
capable of being with you,

238
00:13:13,899 --> 00:13:16,140
you might already have a cute kid,

239
00:13:16,899 --> 00:13:18,199
and you'd tell me, "I'm sorry,

240
00:13:18,880 --> 00:13:20,079
I already have a wife."

241
00:13:34,899 --> 00:13:36,239
How could I possibly have a wife?

242
00:13:36,859 --> 00:13:37,939
Didn't I tell you?

243
00:13:38,020 --> 00:13:39,619
I don't want anyone else but you.

244
00:13:42,460 --> 00:13:43,479
When I saw

245
00:13:44,880 --> 00:13:46,399
that book at your place,

246
00:13:46,699 --> 00:13:47,699
I knew

247
00:13:48,560 --> 00:13:49,760
you were a lawyer.

248
00:13:50,920 --> 00:13:51,920
In the future,

249
00:13:53,399 --> 00:13:55,039
you'll definitely be on top of the world.

250
00:13:59,260 --> 00:14:00,260
But

251
00:14:02,000 --> 00:14:03,599
while you're chatting
and laughing with others,

252
00:14:03,600 --> 00:14:04,600
I'll be

253
00:14:04,739 --> 00:14:05,859
singing at a bar.

254
00:14:06,199 --> 00:14:07,719
I'll be drinking with people at a bar.

255
00:14:08,939 --> 00:14:09,899
I'll be delivering packages.

256
00:14:09,900 --> 00:14:10,980
I'll be delivering takeout.

257
00:14:13,659 --> 00:14:14,859
I'm not good enough for you.

258
00:14:20,960 --> 00:14:22,180
Why would you think that?

259
00:14:23,800 --> 00:14:24,800
You're still young.

260
00:14:25,239 --> 00:14:26,800
You have a long life ahead of you.

261
00:14:27,859 --> 00:14:29,220
Why do you put yourself down?

262
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:35,439
Because I'm scared!

263
00:14:40,819 --> 00:14:41,819
Alright.

264
00:14:43,260 --> 00:14:44,260
Actually,

265
00:14:45,319 --> 00:14:47,420
I'm the one who's truly pathetic.

266
00:14:49,920 --> 00:14:51,159
Haven't you always asked me

267
00:14:52,720 --> 00:14:54,479
why I came to Jinyang from Fengzhou?

268
00:14:56,840 --> 00:14:58,020
I'll tell you today.

269
00:15:01,819 --> 00:15:03,919
I was, in fact, a lawyer.

270
00:15:05,279 --> 00:15:07,060
But that was five years ago.

271
00:15:11,199 --> 00:15:13,960
I was the youngest licensed
lawyer in the entire firm.

272
00:15:15,140 --> 00:15:16,279
On top of the world.

273
00:15:20,000 --> 00:15:21,500
But something happened

274
00:15:24,180 --> 00:15:25,899
that completely changed my life.

275
00:15:29,260 --> 00:15:30,560
It was very late that night.

276
00:15:31,439 --> 00:15:33,436
I had just finished a meeting
with a client at a hotel

277
00:15:33,460 --> 00:15:35,180
and was heading to the rooftop for a smoke.

278
00:16:08,140 --> 00:16:09,340
I was terrified.

279
00:16:09,739 --> 00:16:11,619
I didn't dare let anyone know I was there.

280
00:16:12,659 --> 00:16:14,279
So I hid for a long time.

281
00:16:15,899 --> 00:16:17,680
Until I was sure the killer had left,

282
00:16:20,579 --> 00:16:21,640
I didn't dare come out.

283
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:33,899
The next morning,

284
00:16:34,420 --> 00:16:35,760
the news broke out.

285
00:16:36,920 --> 00:16:38,800
Not long after, the hotel
went out of business.

286
00:16:39,479 --> 00:16:40,858
Everything about that night,

287
00:16:40,859 --> 00:16:42,979
all the surveillance footage
and videos, disappeared.

288
00:16:43,960 --> 00:16:45,100
And the video on my phone,

289
00:16:49,359 --> 00:16:50,520
the one I recorded,

290
00:16:51,060 --> 00:16:52,500
became the only piece of evidence.

291
00:16:55,619 --> 00:16:56,979
I was so scared at the time.

292
00:17:00,100 --> 00:17:01,319
I went to many places

293
00:17:02,020 --> 00:17:03,300
to ask around about it.

294
00:17:03,739 --> 00:17:04,739
But I found out

295
00:17:04,939 --> 00:17:06,800
that all the media reports from that day

296
00:17:06,960 --> 00:17:07,960
were completely gone.

297
00:17:08,560 --> 00:17:10,779
And the killer vanished without a trace.

298
00:17:12,100 --> 00:17:13,060
You can imagine

299
00:17:13,061 --> 00:17:14,920
how massive the power behind him must be.

300
00:17:18,060 --> 00:17:20,060
I don't know who ordered him to do it.

301
00:17:21,359 --> 00:17:22,479
The person behind it all,

302
00:17:23,199 --> 00:17:24,899
their motives, their methods,

303
00:17:25,539 --> 00:17:26,698
or even how many people were involved,

304
00:17:26,699 --> 00:17:27,699
I have no idea.

305
00:17:29,520 --> 00:17:31,020
So I didn't know what to do.

306
00:17:34,699 --> 00:17:35,699
And then?

307
00:17:36,619 --> 00:17:37,760
And then I left.

308
00:17:40,819 --> 00:17:41,899
I was terrified.

309
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:44,599
From that day on,

310
00:17:44,600 --> 00:17:46,160
I've had nightmares every single night.

311
00:17:48,039 --> 00:17:50,300
Dreaming of the
gruesome way that girl died.

312
00:17:52,800 --> 00:17:54,040
She's been dead for five years,

313
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:58,020
and I've had these
nightmares for five years.

314
00:18:01,119 --> 00:18:02,920
I didn't have the courage to step forward.

315
00:18:04,819 --> 00:18:05,979
I failed her.

316
00:18:13,380 --> 00:18:14,380
Is this

317
00:18:16,659 --> 00:18:18,300
the reason you came to Jinyang?

318
00:18:18,920 --> 00:18:20,399
Because she was also from Jinyang.

319
00:18:22,859 --> 00:18:24,939
Her parents traveled all over

320
00:18:26,119 --> 00:18:27,800
just to find the truth for her.

321
00:18:28,340 --> 00:18:30,180
But I couldn't bravely step forward.

322
00:18:33,220 --> 00:18:34,300
So that day,

323
00:18:36,039 --> 00:18:37,300
when you saw me in a suit,

324
00:18:39,159 --> 00:18:40,679
I was going to pay my respects to her.

325
00:18:43,380 --> 00:18:44,380
I'm sorry.

326
00:18:45,100 --> 00:18:46,100
That day I even...

327
00:18:46,979 --> 00:18:47,979
It's okay.

328
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:50,620
None of that matters anymore.

329
00:18:51,619 --> 00:18:52,619
So you see,

330
00:18:53,560 --> 00:18:54,680
I'm the one who is

331
00:18:54,920 --> 00:18:56,140
dirty, cowardly,

332
00:18:56,840 --> 00:18:58,239
and pathetic.

333
00:18:59,899 --> 00:19:01,600
I'm the one who isn't good enough for you.

334
00:19:04,800 --> 00:19:05,800
No, you're not.

335
00:19:07,460 --> 00:19:08,579
The person I see in you

336
00:19:10,020 --> 00:19:11,880
has always been someone responsible.

337
00:19:13,199 --> 00:19:14,199
If you didn't speak up,

338
00:19:14,699 --> 00:19:16,420
you definitely had your reasons.

339
00:19:19,159 --> 00:19:20,720
I was just making excuses for myself.

340
00:19:22,220 --> 00:19:23,220
Actually,

341
00:19:23,880 --> 00:19:24,880
I always

342
00:19:25,060 --> 00:19:27,020
said I was afraid my
parents would be implicated.

343
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:29,159
I always felt

344
00:19:29,160 --> 00:19:30,859
like I couldn't fight against them.

345
00:19:31,539 --> 00:19:33,301
But at the end of the day,
those were all just excuses.

346
00:19:34,619 --> 00:19:35,779
Upholding justice,

347
00:19:37,140 --> 00:19:38,260
embracing reverence,

348
00:19:41,079 --> 00:19:42,079
I failed to do that.

349
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:45,420
No.

350
00:19:46,880 --> 00:19:49,020
Everyone has things they're afraid of.

351
00:19:49,979 --> 00:19:51,359
You just need time,

352
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:54,399
you need a way,

353
00:19:55,079 --> 00:19:56,579
and you need help to resolve it.

354
00:19:58,880 --> 00:20:00,840
Now you've seen the real Teng Mo.

355
00:20:04,119 --> 00:20:05,720
You can choose to leave me.

356
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:08,659
Being with me might
put you in a lot of danger.

357
00:20:09,560 --> 00:20:11,119
It might even cost you your life.

358
00:20:15,500 --> 00:20:16,980
I don't know if you're still willing.

359
00:20:40,100 --> 00:20:41,100
Now,

360
00:20:41,500 --> 00:20:42,940
there's no taking it back, is there?

361
00:20:45,260 --> 00:20:46,739
After all, I've already put it on.
